          "text": "Description: On October 18, 1994, around 2:00 PM, a gendarme on leave, while collecting mushrooms, discovered on the ground a circle composed of rock fragments resembling slag. The leaves in contact with the rocks had taken on a sulfurous green hue. As night fell, he decided to return the next day but was unable to locate the site again.",
